    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harrington is pleased to present 50 Rothe Abbey, a two-bedroom home tucked away in an established residential development off South Circular Road. The property offers a comfortable layout, bright living spaces and a private, beautfully landscaped rear garden, all within easy reach of Dublin city centre.\r\n\r\nThe entrance hall leads to a living room with timber flooring and a feature fireplace. Double doors connect the living room to the kitchen and dining area, giving the ground floor an easy flow. The kitchen has fitted timber cabinets, integrated cooking appliances and space for a dining table. Glazed doors open directly onto the rear garden. Upstairs are two bedrooms, both with timber flooring and fitted storage. \r\n\r\nRothe Abbey is a mature residential development and is well placed for the shops, cafés and amenities of Rialto and Kilmainham nearby. The area offers easy access to the city centre, while the Royal Hospital Kilmainham and the Phoenix Park provide excellent options for walks and time outdoors. The local area is serviced by LUAS and Dublin Bus."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor\r\n\r\nEntrance hall: \r\nAccess to the living room and stairs to the first floor.\r\n\r\nLiving room: 3.77m × 5.96m \r\nBright reception room with a feature fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining room: 3.77m × 2.50m\r\nFitted kitchen with space for dining and glazed doors opening to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n\r\nBedroom One: 3.77m × 3.41m \r\nSpacious double bedroom with timber flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two: 3.77m × 2.73m: \r\nDouble bedroom with timber flooring overlooking the rear.\r\n\r\nBathroom: 1.95m × 2.22m: \r\nFitted with a bath, wash hand basin and WC."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Two-bedroom home in a beautiful established enclave\r\nBright, connected ground-floor living space\r\nTimber flooring throughout the rooms\r\nFitted kitchen with dining area\r\nMahogany glazed doors opening to the stunning landscaped rear garden\r\nFitted bedroom storage\r\nOff-street parking\r\nConvenient South Circular Road location"
      },
      {
